This python code uses "requests", "json", and "urllib3" libraries.

At this moment I am skipping SSL check on my Zabbix URL. Reenable if you want/need.

Remember to replace Zabbix URL and API token with enough permissions.

Also, my tree is based on host tags, and looks like
Environment (no parent)
  └── Version (child of Environment)
        └── Client (child of Version) with both service and problem tags.
Change as needed

Hope this code helps!
